  "privacyPolicy": "Privacy Policy",
  "legalDraftNotice": "Draft text, to be reviewed by LUTIANO's legal adviser before the app is released.",
  "termsBody": "## Who these terms are for\nThis app is for LUTIANO sellers. Your account is created by LUTIANO and is for your use only.\n\n## Your account\nKeep your password private and never share your account. Everything done with your account is recorded under your name. If you think someone else knows your password, change it or sign out of all other devices from Security.\n\n## Recording sales and stock\nRecord each sale, cash movement and stock movement accurately and on time. Do not record sales that did not happen. Corrections go through a refund or a request, never through a second sale.\n\n## Money and stock\nYou are responsible for the cash and stock you handle during your shift. Differences found when closing a shift are recorded and reviewed by the team.\n\n## Earnings\nCommissions, bonuses and payouts follow the rules set by LUTIANO and shown in the Earnings tab. Figures are provisional until the month is finalised.\n\n## Acceptable use\nUse the app only for LUTIANO work. Do not try to access data you are not allowed to see, and do not interfere with the app or its servers.\n\n## Ending access\nLUTIANO can suspend or close an account when a seller leaves or when these terms are not respected.\n\n## Changes and contact\nThese terms may change; the app will show the new version. For any question, use Help & Support in your profile.",
  "privacyBody": "## What we keep about you\nYour name, phone number, email address, profile photo, language, the locations you work at, and your sign-in history. If the app crashes, a report with the error and your phone model is sent to our technical team; it contains no personal details.\n\n## What we record while you work\nThe sales, cash movements, stock requests, shifts and support requests you make, with the time and place they were made, so that the business can count its money and stock and calculate your earnings.\n\n## Notifications\nTo send you messages we keep the token of your phone for push notifications, and your notification choices. You can switch non-essential notifications off in Notification Settings.\n\n## Why we use it\nTo run the business, pay you correctly, keep accounts secure and answer your support requests. We do not sell your data and we do not use it for advertising.\n\n## Who can see it\nAdministrators and managers at LUTIANO, within what their role needs. Service providers we use to send SMS and push notifications receive only what is needed to deliver the message.\n\n## How long we keep it\nBusiness records are kept as long as the law and the accounts require. Read notifications are removed after 90 days. When you leave, your account is closed and personal details not needed for the records can be removed on request.\n\n## Your choices\nYou can change your name, phone and photo in your profile, change the app language, and ask us through Help & Support to see, correct or delete your personal data.\n\n## Security\nYour session is kept in your phone's secure storage and ends when you sign out. Sign-in codes and passwords are never shown in the app.\n\n## Contact\nUse Help & Support in your profile for any privacy question.",
